-	+
-		 auto (to solve): margin-bottom
-	+
-		1in : bottom
-	=============
-		3in  : height of containing block
-
-
-		So, here, margin-top must use 0.25in and margin-bottom must use 0.25in
-		so that the equation remains balanced.
-
-    */
-        </style>
